<view class="profile-edit-page">
  <view class="intro-card">
    <text class="intro-title">个人资料</text>
    <text class="intro-desc">登录账号与九辰内部身份分开管理。首次登录默认为游客，填写正确内部ID后系统自动切换对应身份。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="identity-card">
    <view class="identity-head">
      <view>
        <text class="identity-title">九辰内部ID</text>
        <text class="identity-desc" wx:if="{{!identityLocked}}">由九辰提供。绑定成功后不可自行修改。</text>
        <text class="identity-desc" wx:else>已绑定并锁定；如需变更，请联系管理员。</text>
      </view>
      <text class="identity-status">{{identityLocked ? '已绑定' : '未绑定'}}</text>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{identityLocked && identity}}" class="locked-id">
      <text class="locked-code">{{identity.businessId}}</text>
      <text class="locked-role">{{identity.type === 'student' ? '学员' : identity.type === 'teacher' ? '老师' : '管理员'}}</text>
    </view>

    <view wx:else class="claim-row">
      <input
        class="internal-id-input"
        value="{{internalIdInput}}"
        placeholder="例如：JCS-XXXX-XXXX"
        bindinput="onInternalIdInput"
      />
      <button
        class="claim-button"
        loading="{{claiming}}"
        disabled="{{claiming}}"
        bindtap="onClaimInternalId"
      >确认绑定</button>
    </view>
    <text wx:if="{{!identityLocked}}" class="identity-desc">学员、老师和管理员均可凭正确且可用的编号直接绑定；ID被暂停或撤销时无法认领。</text>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{canEditAcademic}}">
    <view class="section-label">学业资料</view>
    <view class="form-card">
      <label class="field">
        <text class="field-label">本科院校</text>
        <input class="field-input" data-field="university" value="{{form.university}}" placeholder="例如：中南大学" bindinput="onFieldInput" />
      </label>
      <label class="field">
        <text class="field-label">专业方向</text>
        <input class="field-input" data-field="major" value="{{form.major}}" placeholder="例如：人工智能" bindinput="onFieldInput" />
      </label>
      <label class="field">
        <text class="field-label">当前年级</text>
        <input class="field-input" data-field="currentGrade" value="{{form.currentGrade}}" placeholder="例如：大二" bindinput="onFieldInput" />
      </label>
      <label class="field">
        <text class="field-label">绩点 / 均分</text>
        <input class="field-input" data-field="gpaText" value="{{form.gpaText}}" placeholder="例如：GPA 3.72 / 4.0" bindinput="onFieldInput" />
      </label>
      <label class="field">
        <text class="field-label">专业排名</text>
        <input class="field-input" data-field="rankText" value="{{form.rankText}}" placeholder="例如：12 / 103" bindinput="onFieldInput" />
      </label>
    </view>

    <button class="save-button" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving || loading}}" bindtap="onSave">保存资料</button>
  </block>

  <view wx:else class="role-note">
    当前身份的业务资料由九辰后台维护；本页只展示你的内部ID绑定状态。
  </view>

  <text class="privacy-note">后续新增资料字段时继续遵循“业务需要再收集”的原则。</text>
</view>
